Rule 27 (If `is_positive_definite` is true, all eigenvalues of the tensor should be positive.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : bool} |= if v_2 = true then min(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 29 (If another tensor v_2 is provided, its dtype should match that of v_1)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
