{v_1 : tensor} |= if shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) then true
>>
Rule 40 (If another tensor v_2 is provided, and is used for solving, its first dimensions needs to be same as the number of columns of v_1)
