{v_1: tensor, v_2: bool} |= if v_2 = true then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) -1) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1)-2)
>>
Rule 65 (If another tensor v_2 is provided, and is used for solving, the shapes of the batch dimensions need to match)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2: tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) > 1 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 2] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
